    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674320/extras/dddf91805c02192fe14269e10ab5ad9e.avif?t=1682526129\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Gran Premio</h2></strong></h2>Gran Premio is a fast paced online multiplayer car racing game. Race with friends and strangers alike throughout the world's most beautiful cities and regions. Drive fast luxury cars, get in police chases, and be the first to the finish line for the biggest slice of the reward pie! Are you ready to whiten your knuckles and risk it all?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dedication to Free-to-Play</h2></strong></h2>Gran Premio is and always will be a free to play game. Feel free to purchase the donation DLC if you feel like supporting the project.",
